---
import { Badge } from "@/components/ui/badge";
---

<section
  id="manifesto"
  class="mx-auto max-w-[90rem] px-5 py-28 sm:px-8 md:py-44"
>
  <div class="grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-12">
    <div class="md:col-span-3" data-reveal>
      <Badge
        variant="outline"
        className="rounded-full border-peach/25 px-3 py-1 text-peach/80"
      >
        01 — Why hands
      </Badge>
    </div>
    <p
      class="text-[clamp(1.9rem,4.4vw,4.5rem)] leading-[1.05] font-light tracking-[-0.035em] md:col-span-9"
      data-scrub
    >
      Your face gets serums, acids, a twelve-step routine. Your hands get
      whatever soap is by the sink. They wash, type, carry, hold. They show the
      years first. sohn is a twenty-minute mask made only for them.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
